equired course 'C' or better, Cal-GETC Areas 1-6 with 'C' or better. Electives: any courses numbered 100-499. Nutrition Department, Health & Health Professions Meta Majors. Distinct from the 2025-2026 'Nutrition UC Path' seed (map 6869, other collector) and from the AS-T Nutrition and Dietetics (map 7536). tccns mirrors SCC local course codes (California community colleges do not use TCCNS).",
